2 CONC erem parentes
2 CONT 16 Jorge Mz Gayo-Gayos § 1 N5
2 CONT 16 António Martins Gayo Gayos § 13 
2 CONT 16 João Martins Gayo - Gayos § 56 
2 CONT 16 Felipa Martins Gayo - § 15»
