1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Not son of  https://www.geni.com/people/Munio-o-Nu%C3%B1o-Guti%C3%A9rrez-Conde-de-Celanova/6000000002487912490 (MP DIY locked abandoned)
2 CONT
2 CONT *Not know son of https://www.geni.com/people/Guterre-De-Men%C3%A9ndez-2-%C2%BA-Conde-Del-Sobrado/6000000017663051374 
