2 CONT iv)       TERESA Gonçales .  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "Condesa D. Elvira de Faya, D. Teresa Gonçalez" as the children of "D. Gonçalo Mendez de Sousa" and his second wife "D. Dordia Veegas", and in another pa
2 CONC ssage records that "D. Vasco Fernandez" married "D. Teresa Gonçalez de Sousa"[115].  
2 CONT
