2 CONT '''MAYOR Rodríguez''' [Guntroda] (-after 6 Jan 1129).  The Historia Compostelana names “Petrus Froylaz comes…comitissa Dña Mayor uxor…Munina Froylaz soror…Visclavara Froylaz…soror”[125].  "Petrus […Froilaz] et comes et cometessa G
2 CONC unterede Ruderiquiz" donated "Nemenio" to the monastery of Santo Tomé de Nemeño by charter dated 6 May 1105[126].  Queen Urraca granted property to "comiti dno Petro Froyalz et uxori uestre comitisse dne Maiori Roderici de Rarzena
2 CONC " by charter dated May 1112[127].  "Semena Monios…cum sobrinos meis Sancia Roiz et Major Roiz et cum filiis comitis Fernandi et comitiesse domine Enderquine" donated "monasterium Sancte Crucis de Castanneda" to Cluny by charter da
2 CONC ted 20 Sep 1120 made "pro animabus comitis Monionis et uxoris sue comitisse domine Maioris et…comitis Rodrici et…fratrum nostrorum et sororum nostrarum"[128].  "…Comitissa domna Maior, comitissa domna Lupa, Munia Froilaz, Uisclaua
2 CONC ra Froilaz" subscribed the charter dated 25 Jul 1122 under which "[Uere]mundus Petri" granted arras to "uxori mee infanti domne Orrache filie comitis domni Anrrich et regine domne Tarasie"[129].  “Maior Ruderici comitissa, comitis
2 CONC  Ruderici et comitisse Tharasie filie" donated “medietatem monasterii Sancte Marie de Feleta...in Cholcantes...et in Adecia meam portionem...in...ecclesia Sancti Christofori in Chazaron, meam portionem...in ecclesia de Montecello.
