1 NOTE Raised in the court of Alfonso VI married 1087 Urraca Froilaz daughter of Count Froila Arias de Traba and Ardiu Didaci. Grandson of Hermenegildo Gutierrez.
2 CONT See also Alfonso Froilaz El Jorobado, Born 911 died 933 who was king of Leon and Galecia 925 through 926. Sone was Ordono IV. Was also family of Fruela II de Leon whose wife was Nunila Jimena, daughter of Sancho Garces I. Married 
2 CONC Urraca of the Banu Qasi de Tudela.
