2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Henri le Damoiseau, duc de Bourgogne and Sibylle de Barcelone, duchesse consort de Bourgogne 
2 CONT * Henry (Portuguese: Henrique, French: Henri; c. 1066 – 1112), Count of Portugal, was the first member of the Capetian House of Burgundy to rule Portugal and the father of the country's first king, Afonso Henriques.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/PORTUGAL.htm#_Toc498671010 Project MedLands, Chapter 1. KINGS OF PORTUGAL 1113-1383 (BURGUNDY-CAPET)]
