2 CONT
2 CONT 5.         '''TERESA de Entenza''' .  The testament of "don Gombalt d´Entenca senyor d´Alcolea", dated 12 Sep 1304, bequeathes property to "…Tharesa fillya mía que finqua con dona Teresa hermana mía…por a su casamento…"[2560].  [S
2 CONC antiago names “Teresa Gombal de Entenza, hija de Bernardo Guillén de Entenza, prima hermana del rey Jaime I” as the wife of “Berenguer V de Entenza”, but does not cite the corresponding primary source[2561].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' BERENGUER de Entenza, son of BERENGUER de Entenza & his wife Guillelma de Luesia (-murdered after 1305).] 
2 CONT
