2 CONT 6.         ELVIRA González Girón (-after 8 May 1222).  The Nobiliario of Pedro Conde de Barcelos names "D. Ruy Gonçalez, D. Elvira Gonçalez Giron" as the children of "D. Gonçalo Roiz Giron" and his wife "D. Elvira Diaz", a later p
2 CONC assage recording that "D. Juan Alonso de Tello" married "D. Elvira Gonçalez Giron"[1152].  From a chronological point of view, it is unlikely that the wife of Juan Alfonso Tellez de Meneses, who died in 1268, was the daughter of G
2 CONC onzalo Rodríguez by his first marriage.  "Don Gonzalo Roiz maiordomo del rei de Castella e mios fiios et fiias que oue de donna Sancha Roiz…a saber don Rodrigo Gonzaluez et Theresa Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de so marido, Roi Gonz
2 CONC aluez, et Maria Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de so marido, Guillem Pedrez e Aldonza Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de so marido, Ramiro Frolez et Eluira Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de la abbadessa e del conuento de Sancta Maria la Real d
2 CONC e Burgos, e Sancha Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de la abbadessa e del conuento de Sant Andres de Arroio, e Brigida Gonzaluez con otorgamiento de la abbadessa e del conuento de Perales…" ratified donations to the bishopric of Palenci
2 CONC a by charter dated 8 May 1222[1153]. 
