2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro & his third wife had [three] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT iv)           don GONZALO Pérez de Lara .  3rd Señor de Molina y Mesa.  m doña SANCHA Gómez de Traba, daughter of don GÓMEZ Gónzalez de Traba & his [first/second] wife ---.  Gonzalo & his wife had one child: 
