2 CONT (a)          doña MAFALDA González de Lara (-[before Sep 1244]).  Señora de Molina y Mesa.  m (1240) as his first wife, Infante don ALFONSO de León Señor de Soria, son of don ALFONSO IX King of León & his second wife Infanta doña 
2 CONC Berenguela de Castilla (Autumn 1202-Salamanca 6 Jan 1272, bur Ciudad Real, castle of Calatrava-la-Nueva).  Señor de Molina y Mesa in 1240, by right of his wife.   
2 CONT
