2 CONC mano/congermano” is more often interpreted as cousin, under the suggested reconstruction shown here Nuño Pérez would have been Aurembiax´s maternal uncle, although born from her maternal grandfather´s third marriage and so born ar
2 CONC ound the same time as Aurembiax herself.] 
2 CONT
