2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor of Guzman (c. 1310 – 1351) was a mistress of King Alfonso XI of Castile. She is known in Spanish as Leonor Núñez de Guzmán.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Seville, daughter of the Castilian nobles Pedro Núñez de Guzmán (descendant of the noble family of Saint Dominic) and Juana Ponce de León (great-granddaughter of King Alfonso IX of León)
