0 @N6000000000374518033@ NOTE BIOGRAPHY: First King of Portugal, from 5 Dec 1143 to 6 Dec 1185.
0 @N6000000002322339624@ NOTE As an infant, he inherited his father's title, and in 1128 he defeated his
1 CONT mother, Teresa, in battle, and became the first King of Portugal. He
1 CONT conquered Santarem and Lisbon from the Muslims in 1147 and secured Portuguese
1 CONT independence frm Leon in 1139. By the time of his death he had created a
1 CONT stable and independent monarchy, succeeded by his son, Sancho I.
0 @N6000000002240829624@ NOTE As an infant, he inherited his father's title, and in 1128 he defeated his
1 CONT mother, Teresa, in battle, and became the first King of Portugal. He
1 CONT conquered Santarem and Lisbon from the Muslims in 1147 and secured Portuguese
1 CONT independence frm Leon in 1139. By the time of his death he had created a
1 CONT stable and independent monarchy, succeeded by his son, Sancho I.
