1 CONT Sancho II 
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT Sancho II King of Castile
1 CONT 1072–1109 Succeeded by
1 CONT Urraca 
1 CONT King of León
1 CONT (second reign)
1 CONT 1072–1109 
1 CONT Preceded by
1 CONT García II King of Galicia
1 CONT 1073–1109 
1 CONT King of Portugal
1 CONT 1073–1093 Succeeded by
1 CONT Henry
1 CONT as Count 
1 CONT Vacant 
