1 CONT army. His first marriage provoked discontent amongst his subjects, and with
1 CONT his second marriage there were no sons, only daughter Beatriz, whose marriage
1 CONT led to the most serious national crisis for Portugal with the formation of a
1 CONT new dynasty, the house of Aviz, by her husband, later John I of Portugal.
